{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2023-01-11 08:05:00', 'title': 'PNC EXPANDS ITS ENVIRONMENTAL FINANCE PLEDGE TO $30 BILLION', 'text': "FOCUSED ON GREEN BUILDINGS, RENEWABLE ENERGY AND CLEAN TRANSPORTATION, COMMITMENT DEEPENS THE BANK'S SUPPORT OF CLIENTS TRANSITIONING TO A LOW-CARBON ECONOMY PITTSBURGH , JAN. 11, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP, INC. (NYSE: PNC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THE EXPANSION OF ITS ENVIRONMENTAL FINANCE COMMITMENT TO $30 BILLION. THE BANK INITIALLY ANNOUNCED IN AUGUST 2021 A COMMITMENT OF $20 BILLION OVER FIVE YEARS IN SUPPORT OF ENVIRONMENTAL FINANCE."}